<p>Some links on Doctors AI Tools are affiliate links. If you buy or sign up through one, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links are marked and use <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.</p>

<h2 id="independence">What it does not change</h2>
<ul>
<li>Commissions do not affect scores, rankings or verdicts.</li>
<li>Vendors cannot pay for a review, a ranking or a better score.</li>
<li>We review tools we have no affiliate relationship with, and we say so when a tool has no link.</li>
<li>If we cannot recommend a tool, we say so.</li>
</ul>
<p>Our rules for how content is produced are in the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</p>
<p>Questions about this disclosure? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
